## REDIS AS A SHARED DISTRIBUTED CACHE
--------------------------------------

Ek microservice ki multiple instances same external
Redis Cache ko access kar sakti hain.

For example, Product Service ki 3 instances hain:

        P1
        P2
        P3

In teeno instances ke liye ek shared Product Redis Cache
configured ho sakta hai

Suppose client request bhejta hai:

    GET /products/101


Load Balancer request ko Product Service ki instance `P1`
tak route karta hai.

Agar `product:101` pehli baar request hua hai aur data Product Redis Cache 
me available nahi hoga, to `P1` Product Database se product data retrieve karti hai.

